# Stalactite Stalker: menace (CR 702.111b). Bot1 casts it on turn 1; on turn 3 Bot2's lone Ornithopter may not block it. Unblocked it deals 1 damage.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Stalactite Stalker
Swamp x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Stalactite Stalker.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
Bot1.Attack(Stalactite Stalker > Bot2)
! Bot2.Block(Ornithopter > Stalactite Stalker)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]
? Bot2.Life = 19

